# Per-company brand consistency

DigiSol Hub is multi-tenant. The Working-on company (`hub_client_id`) is the only brand in play.

- Load kits with `getWorkspaceClient` + `brandFromClient`. Never hardcode DigiSol colors, voice, or logo onto another company.
- Seed new clients with `starterBrandForCompany(name)`. DigiSol gets `DIGISOL_BRAND`; everyone else gets `NEUTRAL_BRAND` plus a note that this kit is theirs alone.
- Posters lock **background**, **text**, and **highlights**. Stamp the official logo on a brand-colored bar above the art via `stampOfficialLogo`. Never ask the model to draw a logo or overlay it on copy.
- Email, AI copy, and exports read the same kit (including `{{text}}` and `{{highlight}}`).
- UI copy must say this is per company. Switch Working on to change kits.
